---
import { site } from '../data/site';
const { contact, logo } = site;
---
<section class="wrap section" id="contact">
  <div class="contact">
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">Contact</p>
      <h2>A scoping call is forty-five minutes. We say whether it is our work.</h2>
      <p>Lorem ipsum. What you run, what you have to comply with, and who is asking.</p>
      <address class="address">{logo.text}<br />{contact.address}<br />{contact.phone}</address>
      <a class="btn" href={`mailto:${contact.email}?subject=Ochre%20Signal%20scoping`}>{contact.email}</a>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">Note</p>
      <p>Demo copy. Source firm names have been removed. Recurring managed service is the product.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
